## ✨ Visual Guidelines

- **Clear Space**: 2× symbol height minimum
- **Optical Centering**: Visual center (not mathematical)
- **Glow Effect**: Subtle bloom/luminescence on cyan-violet gradient
- **Depth**: Minimal shadow; emphasize light over form
- **Bloom**: Ethereal, cosmic luminescence

